Notes on usage:
- The parent screen owns the cart state; pass `items`, `onBack` (pop back to the cart view), and `onPay` (call your backend/Telegram invoice flow, e.g. `window.Telegram.WebApp.openInvoice(...)`, and throw/reject on failure to surface `submitError`).
- Colors use Telegram's injected `--tg-theme-*` variables with light-mode fallbacks, so it adapts to the user's Telegram theme automatically.
- Validation is required-field based (name, phone, city, street, postal code); apartment and comment are optional.
